    <string name="perm_popup_dialog_body">Standby will go to the home screen and, about 15 seconds later, try to open its test screen from the background, the way an alarm would. If the screen appears, the permission is on. No sound, nobody is alerted.</string>
    <string name="perm_lock_dialog_title">Test the lock screen</string>
    <string name="perm_lock_dialog_body">After Start, lock the phone with the power button. About 15 seconds later Standby will try to show its test screen over the lock screen, the way an alarm would. Unlock afterwards and come back for the result. No sound, nobody is alerted.</string>
    <string name="perm_boot_dialog_title">Check the restart</string>
